WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.632 --> 00:00:02.133
&gt;&gt;&gt; Good evening.

00:00:02.266 --> 00:00:03.868
I'm Pamela brown in for Erin

00:00:04.001 --> 00:00:04.502
Burnett tonight.

00:00:04.635 --> 00:00:06.604
Welcome to a special edition of

00:00:06.737 --> 00:00:07.205
"Outfront."

00:00:07.338 --> 00:00:09.373
And tonight, ready for anything,

00:00:09.507 --> 00:00:12.777
Ukraine's military preparing for

00:00:13.144 --> 00:00:15.146
provocative acts by rucha to

00:00:15.146 --> 00:00:19.483
mark the one-year anniversary of

00:00:19.617 --> 00:00:20.518
its invasion.

00:00:20.651 --> 00:00:21.986
The warning as president Biden

00:00:22.119 --> 00:00:24.355
made an unprecedented surprise

00:00:24.488 --> 00:00:26.624
visit to Kyiv to meet with

00:00:26.757 --> 00:00:27.858
president zelenskyy, sending a

00:00:27.992 --> 00:00:30.761
painful reminder to Putin of how

00:00:31.162 --> 00:00:33.531
his invasion plans have failed.

00:00:33.664 --> 00:00:35.333
The visit also stinging Russian

00:00:35.466 --> 00:00:37.168
troops already dealing with

00:00:37.201 --> 00:00:39.170
major morale issues.

00:00:39.437 --> 00:00:41.305
A telegram account managed by

00:00:41.439 --> 00:00:43.274
Russian military bloggers noting

00:00:43.407 --> 00:00:45.576
Biden has done something Putin

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:47.378
has not, saying, quote, almost a

00:00:47.511 --> 00:00:48.312
year after the beginning of the

00:00:48.446 --> 00:00:51.749
special military operation, we

00:00:51.882 --> 00:00:53.484
are waiting in the Russian city

00:00:53.618 --> 00:00:55.186
of Kyiv for the president of the

00:00:55.186 --> 00:00:56.287
Russian Federation but not for

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:58.856
the president of the united

00:00:59.190 --> 00:00:59.323
States.

00:00:59.457 --> 00:01:01.192
And the man Putin has turned to

00:01:01.292 --> 00:01:03.527
in hopes of winning this war is

00:01:03.661 --> 00:01:06.631
also now complaining he lacks

00:01:06.764 --> 00:01:07.965
the necessary equipment.

00:01:08.099 --> 00:01:10.368
Yevgeny prigozhin, the head of

00:01:10.501 --> 00:01:12.403
the Wagner group, the brutal

00:01:12.536 --> 00:01:15.206
private mercenary group, saying

00:01:15.206 --> 00:01:15.306
this.

00:01:15.439 --> 00:01:16.207
&gt;&gt; Translator: All the questions

00:01:16.474 --> 00:01:19.210
I raised about ammunition,

00:01:19.277 --> 00:01:21.212
unfortunately, stay completely

00:01:21.212 --> 00:01:21.479
unresolved.

00:01:21.612 --> 00:01:24.815
And it is the most serious

00:01:25.216 --> 00:01:25.283
problem.

00:01:25.283 --> 00:01:27.251
I'm unable to solve this problem

00:01:27.385 --> 00:01:30.187
despite all my connections,

00:01:30.321 --> 00:01:31.889
contacts, and everything is

00:01:32.023 --> 00:01:33.624
sinking and sticking.

00:01:33.758 --> 00:01:36.594
&gt;&gt; But Russia still showing no

00:01:36.727 --> 00:01:38.596
signs of retreat at all,

00:01:38.729 --> 00:01:40.564
including in Ukraine's eastern

00:01:40.698 --> 00:01:42.233
donetsk region, which is under

00:01:42.366 --> 00:01:43.734
constant shelling as Putin looks

00:01:43.868 --> 00:01:45.236
for any claim to victory just

00:01:45.336 --> 00:01:46.671
hours before a major speech to

00:01:46.804 --> 00:01:47.238
his country.

00:01:47.371 --> 00:01:48.439
We have reporters tonight in

00:01:48.572 --> 00:01:49.774
Ukraine and Russia.

00:01:49.907 --> 00:01:50.908
Fred pleitgen is in Moscow.

00:01:51.242 --> 00:01:51.709
But let's start with Alex

00:01:51.842 --> 00:01:53.244
Marquardt in Kyiv.

00:01:53.277 --> 00:01:54.278
Alex, what is the latest there

00:01:54.412 --> 00:01:57.815
on the ground where you are?

00:01:57.948 --> 00:01:59.250
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Well, Pamela,

00:01:59.250 --> 00:01:59.884
president Biden is now back

00:02:00.017 --> 00:02:01.252
across the border.

00:02:01.252 --> 00:02:02.887
He is in Warsaw tonight.

00:02:03.254 --> 00:02:04.488
He was here in Kyiv not just at

00:02:05.256 --> 00:02:06.057
a symbolic moment, because we

00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:07.291
are marking the first

00:02:07.425 --> 00:02:08.659
anniversary of Russia's invasion

00:02:08.793 --> 00:02:09.894
of Ukraine later this week, but

00:02:10.027 --> 00:02:11.362
at a strategic moment as well.

00:02:11.495 --> 00:02:12.663
This is a real inflexion point

00:02:12.797 --> 00:02:14.131
in this conflict.

00:02:14.265 --> 00:02:15.466
Ukraine is expected in the

00:02:15.599 --> 00:02:17.735
coming weeks to mount a new

00:02:17.868 --> 00:02:19.370
counteroffensive, to try to take

00:02:19.503 --> 00:02:20.404
back territory.

00:02:20.538 --> 00:02:21.272
Likely in the southern part of

00:02:21.272 --> 00:02:22.573
the country.

00:02:22.707 --> 00:02:23.974
That is what at least some of

00:02:24.108 --> 00:02:27.278
the $500 million military aid

00:02:27.278 --> 00:02:28.713
package was going to be aimed at

00:02:28.846 --> 00:02:31.615
that was announced today at

00:02:31.749 --> 00:02:32.817
near-term offensive objectives.

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:34.118
At the same time, Pamela, we are

00:02:34.251 --> 00:02:36.120
starting to see the early stages

00:02:36.253 --> 00:02:39.690
of a new Russian offensive on at

00:02:39.824 --> 00:02:40.725
least four different axes in the

00:02:40.858 --> 00:02:41.792
eastern part of the country.

00:02:41.926 --> 00:02:43.294
It is not going well for them.

00:02:43.294 --> 00:02:45.730
They are losing a lot of men.

00:02:45.863 --> 00:02:49.300
Now, both offensives due to

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:52.103
start early as this war enters

00:02:52.236 --> 00:02:55.906
its second year.

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:56.240
Pamela?

00:02:56.374 --> 00:02:57.875
Russian forces trying, and so

00:02:58.008 --> 00:03:00.044
far, failing to make real

00:03:00.177 --> 00:03:01.445
headway in the opening stages of

00:03:01.579 --> 00:03:02.780
a new offensive in eastern

00:03:02.913 --> 00:03:03.314
Ukraine.

00:03:04.382 --> 00:03:06.150
A devastating toll on both sides

00:03:06.283 --> 00:03:08.452
in the months-long battle for

00:03:08.586 --> 00:03:09.854
back multiwhere Ukraine is

00:03:09.987 --> 00:03:12.390
mostly facing mercenaries and

00:03:12.523 --> 00:03:15.326
convicts from the private Wagner

00:03:15.426 --> 00:03:15.593
group.

00:03:15.726 --> 00:03:17.328
Taking the time to thank

00:03:17.361 --> 00:03:18.796
president Joe Biden for his

00:03:18.929 --> 00:03:20.030
historic visit to Ukraine.

00:03:20.164 --> 00:03:21.332
&gt;&gt; Translator: This is the most

00:03:21.332 --> 00:03:22.266
powerful message of support for

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:23.768
Ukraine at this moment.

00:03:23.901 --> 00:03:25.336
&gt;&gt; Reporter: In the capital, the

00:03:25.336 --> 00:03:27.571
U.S. And Ukrainian presidents

00:03:27.705 --> 00:03:30.808
seemingly undeterred by an air

00:03:30.941 --> 00:03:31.509
raid siren trying to show the

00:03:31.642 --> 00:03:33.344
world they are in lockstep.

00:03:33.477 --> 00:03:35.346
Together briefly visiting St.

00:03:35.346 --> 00:03:36.547
Michael's church before emerging

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:38.048
to lay a pair of wreaths.

00:03:38.182 --> 00:03:39.350
The Ukrainian and American flags

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:40.985
in front of a wall of portraits

00:03:41.352 --> 00:03:42.486
of soldiers who died in the

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:43.821
fight with Russia.

00:03:43.954 --> 00:03:46.390
Biden keen to remind Russian

00:03:46.524 --> 00:03:47.425
president Vladimir Putin of his

00:03:47.558 --> 00:03:49.360
failures in the past year.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:52.863
&gt;&gt; Putin thought Ukraine was

00:03:52.997 --> 00:03:55.366
weak and the west was divided.

00:03:55.399 --> 00:03:56.867
As you know, Mr. President, I

00:03:57.001 --> 00:03:57.735
said to you at the beginning,

00:03:57.868 --> 00:04:01.372
he's counting on us not sticking

00:04:01.439 --> 00:04:01.672
together.

00:04:01.806 --> 00:04:05.709
He thought he could outlast us.

00:04:05.843 --> 00:04:06.644
I don't think he's thinking that

00:04:06.777 --> 00:04:07.411
right now.

00:04:07.545 --> 00:04:08.112
&gt;&gt; Reporter: While zelenskyy

00:04:08.245 --> 00:04:09.380
called the moment the most

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:11.749
important in the history of the

00:04:11.882 --> 00:04:12.583
u.s./ukraine relationship.

00:04:12.716 --> 00:04:14.185
&gt;&gt; Translator: This is the visit

00:04:14.318 --> 00:04:15.553
in this most difficult period

00:04:15.686 --> 00:04:16.454
for Ukraine when Ukraine is

00:04:16.587 --> 00:04:19.757
fighting for our own liberty.

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:20.791
Today our negotiations were very

00:04:20.925 --> 00:04:21.392
fruitful.

00:04:21.392 --> 00:04:23.461
They were very important and

00:04:23.594 --> 00:04:23.794
crucial.

00:04:23.928 --> 00:04:25.529
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Negotiations about

00:04:25.663 --> 00:04:27.398
continued military aid.

00:04:27.498 --> 00:04:28.833
Today president Biden announcing

00:04:28.966 --> 00:04:31.502
an almost half-billion dollars

00:04:31.635 --> 00:04:32.603
aid package for Ukraine,

00:04:32.736 --> 00:04:35.039
including ammunition, and air

00:04:35.406 --> 00:04:35.539
defenses.

00:04:35.539 --> 00:04:37.408
But big-ticket items that

00:04:37.408 --> 00:04:39.677
Ukraine wants, like longer-range

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:41.579
missiles and fighter jets still

00:04:41.712 --> 00:04:42.780
up for discussion.

00:04:42.913 --> 00:04:44.782
&gt;&gt; Translator: This conversation

00:04:44.915 --> 00:04:45.850
brings us closer to victory.

00:04:45.983 --> 00:04:47.685
&gt;&gt; Reporter: This surprised

00:04:47.818 --> 00:04:48.853
unprecedented visit on the eve

00:04:48.986 --> 00:04:52.089
of a bloody anniversary.

00:04:52.223 --> 00:04:53.424
Extreme secrecy shrouding

00:04:53.424 --> 00:04:53.924
Biden's journey.

00:04:54.058 --> 00:04:56.627
No word, but there were signs,

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:58.696
deserted streets and a heavy

00:04:58.829 --> 00:05:01.098
police presence suggesting a

00:05:01.432 --> 00:05:02.266
prominent arrival.

00:05:02.399 --> 00:05:04.568
President Biden quietly left

00:05:04.702 --> 00:05:06.504
Washington for Poland just after

00:05:06.637 --> 00:05:07.705
4:00 A.M. Under the cover of

00:05:07.838 --> 00:05:09.573
darkness, and after a long train

00:05:09.707 --> 00:05:11.442
ride across western Ukraine,

00:05:11.542 --> 00:05:13.043
arrived to warm smiles and

00:05:13.444 --> 00:05:14.712
laughter from Ukraine's first

00:05:14.845 --> 00:05:15.045
couple.

00:05:15.446 --> 00:05:17.448
His feelings left in a

00:05:17.448 --> 00:05:18.983
hand-written message about

00:05:19.116 --> 00:05:19.984
solidarity and friendship, which

00:05:20.117 --> 00:05:22.152
was echoed on the streets of

00:05:22.286 --> 00:05:22.553
Kyiv.

00:05:22.686 --> 00:05:23.621
&gt;&gt; Translator: It is support for

00:05:23.754 --> 00:05:24.822
us and a message for the

00:05:24.955 --> 00:05:26.991
Russians that this issue must be

00:05:27.124 --> 00:05:29.159
resolved and Ukraine must win.

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:30.561
We hope that his visit will

00:05:30.694 --> 00:05:33.931
speed up the events.

00:05:34.064 --> 00:05:35.132
&gt;&gt; Reporter: And, Pamela, the

00:05:35.466 --> 00:05:36.367
white house says that they

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:38.536
warned the Kremlin that Biden

00:05:38.669 --> 00:05:39.670
would be here in Ukraine several

00:05:39.803 --> 00:05:41.138
hours before he arrived, part of

00:05:41.472 --> 00:05:44.441
what they call the deconfliction

00:05:44.575 --> 00:05:44.775
process.

00:05:44.909 --> 00:05:46.343
Now, national security adviser

00:05:46.477 --> 00:05:47.945
Jake Sullivan, who was with

00:05:48.078 --> 00:05:49.480
Biden, he did not say what the

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:52.750
message was to the Kremlin, nor

00:05:52.883 --> 00:05:53.484
what their response was.

00:05:53.617 --> 00:05:55.519
But it was clear they did not

00:05:55.653 --> 00:05:56.921
want anything to happen for

00:05:57.054 --> 00:05:58.455
Biden while he was here for

00:05:58.589 --> 00:05:59.490
almost 24 hours in Ukraine.

